From d455d467d105e8f5ead4080cc417d6ce329b7ab6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Evelyn Tsai <evelyn.tsai@mediatek.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 15:56:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] mtk: mt76: mt7915: add WLAN ID bounds check in
 mt7915_mmio_wed_update_rx_stats

Add an out-of-bounds guard before accessing the WCID in
mt7915_mmio_wed_update_rx_stats. If the WLAN index from WO RX stats
is zero or exceeds the WTBL size, bail out early to avoid accessing
an invalid WCID.

Signed-off-by: Evelyn Tsai <evelyn.tsai@mediatek.com>
---
 mt7915/mmio.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/mt7915/mmio.c b/mt7915/mmio.c
index 480efd9f1..f5e3eacb1 100644
--- a/mt7915/mmio.c
+++ b/mt7915/mmio.c
@@ -588,6 +588,9 @@ static void mt7915_mmio_wed_update_rx_stats(struct mtk_wed_device *wed,
 
 	dev = container_of(wed, struct mt7915_dev, mt76.mmio.wed);
 
+	if (idx <= 0 || idx >= mt7915_wtbl_size(dev))
+		return;
+
 	rcu_read_lock();
 
 	wcid = mt76_wcid_ptr(dev, idx);
-- 
